tic.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134406345,imgsize-94159.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[14-year-old Australian artist turns scrap tools into animal sculptures worth $8K]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134397241.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/a-14-year-old-australian-turns-discarded-tools-into-animal-sculptures-and-has-sold-a-scrap-metal-wolf-for-8000-he-is-now-the-youngest-artist-in-a-major-open-studio-event/articleshow/134397241.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/a-14-year-old-australian-turns-discarded-tools-into-animal-sculptures-and-has-sold-a-scrap-metal-wolf-for-8000-he-is-now-the-youngest-artist-in-a-major-open-studio-event/articleshow/134397241.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-23T09:58:59+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134397265,imgsize-981531.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Almost all agents' data stolen? Hackers claim they breached FBI jobs site, stole 2TB of data]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134425198.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[The FBI is currently investigating a cyberattack on its job application website, FBIjobs.gov. ShinyHunters claimed to have stolen over 2 terabytes of sensitive data related to FBI employees and applicants. The group alleged they accessed information through a vulnerability in Oracle’s PeopleSoft system. Cybersecurity experts expressed concerns about the potential long-term risks for affected individuals if the data circulates further.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/almost-all-agents-data-stolen-hackers-claim-they-breached-fbi-jobs-site-stole-2tb-of-data/articleshow/134425198.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/almost-all-agents-data-stolen-hackers-claim-they-breached-fbi-jobs-site-stole-2tb-of-data/articleshow/134425198.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-23T09:15:50+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Prisha Patnaik</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134425245,imgsize-105894.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Iraq suspends Iranian flights to Baghdad after US sanctions threat: Report]]></title><description><![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/iraq-suspends-iranian-flights-to-baghdad-after-us-sanctions-threat-report/articleshow/134424206.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/iraq-suspends-iranian-flights-to-baghdad-after-us-sanctions-threat-report/articleshow/134424206.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-23T08:06:02+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Kanchan Yadav</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134424360,imgsize-278806.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Erika Kirk Idaho Event Dispute: Owens, TPUSA split on student assembly; questions over opt-in]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134340849.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Candace Owens and Turning Point USA are disputing how students attended a Club America event at Nampa Christian School in Idaho. Owens says students were brought to the event as a school assembly and did not voluntarily sign up. TPUSA spokesperson Andrew Kolvet says students could opt out and three did. The disagreement has also raised questions about Erika Kirk's youth outreach.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/wrong-again-andrew-kolvet-hits-back-at-candace-owens-over-claims-about-erika-kirks-idaho-event/articleshow/134340849.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/wrong-again-andrew-kolvet-hits-back-at-candace-owens-over-claims-about-erika-kirks-idaho-event/articleshow/134340849.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-19T03:30:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Sumit Roy</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134340914,imgsize-106780.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Alabama has cleared a $2.52 billion federal loan for its largest infrastructure project ever]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134419778.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A major federal loan has been successfully obtained to facilitate the development of Alabama's most extensive infrastructure scheme. This initiative is designed to tackle persistent traffic challenges on Interstate 10 and enhance the safety of hazardous material transport. A new high-clearance cable-stayed bridge will be constructed to boost vehicle capacity and accommodate larger ships passing through. Commuters will benefit from manageable toll options alongside the preservation of toll-free routes.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/alabama-has-cleared-a-2-52-billion-federal-loan-for-its-largest-infrastructure-project-ever-the-new-mobile-river-bridge-aims-to-end-a-decades-old-bottleneck-and-reroute-hazmat-trucks/articleshow/134419778.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/alabama-has-cleared-a-2-52-billion-federal-loan-for-its-largest-infrastructure-project-ever-the-new-mobile-river-bridge-aims-to-end-a-decades-old-bottleneck-and-reroute-hazmat-trucks/articleshow/134419778.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-23T02:02:04+05:30</pub